                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "this game is super grindy for gems. You can buy gems in the store for real money. In other words: P2W.\nApart from that, an average game, nothing special. Would not recommend however, because it's designed with P2W in mind. Surely there's better tower defense games out there, that just have normal progression and don't rob you blind after you already paid for the game itself.\n\nsome forced impressions: \n[url=https://youtu.be/wfOGpeWd1Tg] Forced Impressions [/url]",
                        "timestamp_created": 1543683029,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1544862068,
                        "voted_up": false,
                        "votes_up": 6,
                        "votes_funny": 0,
                        "weighted_vote_score": 0.5424035787582397,
                        "comment_count": 0,
                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "I'm sorry to hear that, gems were just thinked to help the gamer finish the game in an easier way than the normal one, and also to let people to have unique units (like golems).\nJust because there are In-App Purchases doesn't mean the game is P2W. We tested the game ourselves, and how it is at the moment I can assure it is possible to finish the game without spending any real moey, we would have no problem lowering the difficulty of the game if we notice too many people can't finish the game without buying gems.\n\nIt must also be noticed that players will be rewarded with gems even if they already finished the level before",
                        "timestamp_dev_responded": 1543757351,
                        "primarily_steam_deck": false,
                        "refunded": true
                    }
                ],
